    10488                         temp_gds-name.gdnString @ ub.goods.gds-name
    10489                         sym1 sym2 sym3 sym4 sym5 sym6 sym7 sym8 sym9 sym10
    10490                         sym11 sym12 sym13 sym14 sym15 sym16  sym18  sym20 sym21
    10491                     with frame f-doc-bb .
