    10493                 end.
    10494               end.
    10495               else do:
    10496                 if v-torgconf-outt12 = yes
    10497                 then do:
    10498                     display stream out-stream
    10499                         temp_gds-name.gdnString     @ ub.goods.gds-name
    10500                         sym1 sym2 sym3 sym4 sym5 sym6 sym7 sym8 sym9 sym10
    10501                         sym11 sym12 sym13 sym14 sym15 sym16
    10502                     with frame f-doc-m .
