    14119                               v-tax                       @ stoim-noNDS
    14120                               v-tax-parts-price           @ price-withNDS
    14121                               v-tax                       @ stoim
    14122                               sym1 sym10 sym11 sym12 sym13 sym14 sym15 sym16  sym18
    14123                           with frame f-doc.
