    14168                     display stream out-stream
    14169                         temp_gds-name.gdnString     @ ub.goods.gds-name
    14170                         sym1 sym2 sym3 sym4 sym5 sym6 sym7 sym8 sym9 sym10
    14171                         sym11 sym12 sym13 sym14 sym15 sym16  sym20 sym21
    14172                     with frame f-doc-m-bb .
