    14188                         temp_gds-name.gdnString     @ ub.goods.gds-name
    14189                         sym1 sym2 sym3 sym4 sym5 sym6 sym7 sym8 sym9 sym10
    14190                         sym11 sym12 sym13 sym14 sym15 sym16
    14191                     with frame f-doc-m .
