    14196                         temp_gds-name.gdnString @ ub.goods.gds-name
    14197                         sym1 sym2 sym3 sym4 sym5 sym6 sym7 sym8 sym9 sym10
    14198                         sym11 sym12 sym13 sym14 sym15 sym16  sym18
    14199                     with frame f-doc .
